7,Pitcairn Islands Languages • FamilySearch,https://www.familysearch.org/en/wiki/Pitcairn_Islands_Languages,"December 30, 2022 - Pitkern (also known as Pitcairn-Norfolk or Pitcairnese), is a linguistic cant based on an 18th-century mix of English and Tahitian. It is a primary language of the Pitcairn Islands, though it has more speakers on Norfolk Island. [1]",Pitcairn-Norfolk,Creole
